            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.14+LEV.6.15+LEV.6.16+LEV.6.17+LEV.6.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 6:14–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa achimuambira Aruni na anae ariosala, Eliazari na Ithamari, “Halani hira seemu ya sadaka ya mtsere yosala kula sadaka anazolavirwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. Mtengeze mikahe isiyotiywa hamira na muirye kanda-kanda ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka mana sadaka iyo ni takatifu kabisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundairya Phatu Phatakatifu kpwa sababu hinyo ni mtaloo na chivyazicho kahi za sadaka zireherwazo Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa kuochwa. Hivi ndivyo nirivyoamriwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.7.30+LEV.7.31+LEV.7.32+LEV.7.33+LEV.7.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 7:30–34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela laga chiyounulwa mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu na chiga chinacholaviwa dza sadaka kpwa kuunulwa mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, munaweza kuvirya phatu phophosi ambapho si najisi. Undarya uwe na anao alume na achetu. Vitu hivyo ukahewa kama mtaloo na wa chivyazicho kula sadaka za amani za atu a Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chira chiga chiricholaviwa na laga chiyounulwa mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu andavireha phamwenga na sadaka za marunya ganagolaviwa kpwa kuochwa. Hivyo vindakala vyako phamwenga na anao, hinyo ni mtalo wenu hata kare na kare dza vira Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyolagiza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Musa wauza-uza sana kuhusu hira ndenje ya sadaka ya kuusa dambi, naye achimanya kukala ikaochwa kare. Hivyo achiareyera sana Eliazari na Ithamari, ana a Aruni ariosala, achiauza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.24+LEV.6.25+LEV.6.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 6:24–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kpwa utu wani tamyairya Phatu Phatakatifu? Iyo kala ni chitu chitakatifu kabisa na kala mkaihewa ili kuusa makosa ga Aiziraeli osi phamwenga na kuahendera upatanisho kpwa kuausira dambi mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona, kpwa vira mlatsowe tauyarehwa ndani ya Phatu Phatakatifu, mwalondwa mumurye muhalani mbere ya hema ra mkpwutano dza nrivyolagiza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aruni achimuambira Musa, “Lola, rero akalavya sadaka yao ya kuusa dambi na sadaka yao ya kuochwa mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, na mambo higa gakahendeka. Dze, kalapho nkarya iyo sadaka ya kuusa dambi hivi rero, ingekubalika mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ariphosikira higo, achihamirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
